altxs third-party notices
=========================

This repository ships original encode/decode code under LICENSE (MIT).
The peel binary (`blsmc_prepare`) links cmix-lex preprocess sources at
build time. Those files stay under their upstream licenses.

cmix-lex (dictionary + PHDA9 / WRT / reorder)
---------------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/blahem/cmix-lex
License: GNU GPL v3 (same family as upstream cmix / fxcm / PAQ)

Used here (vendored peel subset, commit `370e698f7ea62168cc64326ff97950c3dc212691`):
  - `dict/english.dic` (WRT dictionary; counted in LTCB S)
  - `dict/new_article_order` (M2 article reorder; required to emit payload_sim)
  - `vendor/cmix-lex/src/readalike_prepr` (M1 split, M2 reorder, M3 PHDA9)
  - `vendor/cmix-lex/src/preprocess` (M4 WRT)
  - `vendor/cmix-lex/src/r1_reorder_transform.*`
  - `vendor/cmix-lex/src/ds` (emhash, used by WRT)

`scripts/fetch_vendors.sh` verifies this subset. `REFRESH=1` re-copies it from upstream.

