UPX (required packer for the peel binary)
----------------------------------------
https://upx.github.io
License: GPL-2.0-or-later
`package_s.sh` always UPX-packs `bin/blsmc_prepare` before `zip -9`. That
packed binary is what enters Total S. Procure with `scripts/fetch_upx.sh`.
UPX itself is not shipped in this tree.

